    <sys:String x:Key="About.PrincipleTitle">安全原则</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.Principle1">密钥和恢复词不上传到同步服务。</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.Principle2">添加联系人前应通过可信渠道核对指纹。</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.Principle3">本地备份不包含恢复词和聊天记录。</sys:String>

